# 32. SECURITY

Do not:

* expose DigitalOcean API tokens
* expose Stripe secrets
* expose database service-role credentials
* expose deployment platform credentials
* trust browser-supplied pricing
* trust browser-supplied plan entitlements
* provision infrastructure directly from client-side code

Sensitive operations must occur server-side.

Validate authorization for every tenant resource.

