# FINAL IMPLEMENTATION PRINCIPLE

Atlas should ultimately support two customer journeys:

### BRING YOUR APPLICATION

Customer
→ Atlas Cloud
→ Select Infrastructure
→ Deploy Application
→ Atlas Manages Infrastructure

### BUY AN ATLAS PRODUCT

Customer
→ Atlas Products
→ Select Application
→ Subscribe
→ Atlas Provisions Environment
→ Customer Configures Business
→ Application Runs on Atlas Cloud

The website being modified now should establish the foundation for both models without pretending that future automation already exists.

Preserve working code, make changes incrementally, keep infrastructure configuration modular, and do not introduce unnecessary dependencies.
